{"version":1,"content":"<p>早上10時50分，警方接報指上水清曉路18號一個地盤對開，一名男工人工作期間，懷疑失平衡跌倒，被鐵枝插傷。</p><p>鐵支插入事主下顎，消防將他救起並連同鐵支一併送威爾斯親王醫院搶救，警方正調查事件原因。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T05:26:54.980702+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":97,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T04:33:06+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T05:20:04.572198+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T05:20:04.572198+00:00","content_hash":"24d462ed8214d47744059cdf7335c39e43ab1d3515d5d557b5036253e96d14ca","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}